    "title": "Illinois Springfield Volleyball Sweeps McKendree 3-0 In Home Opener - NewsBreak",
    "text": "21 hours ago Illinois Springfield secured its second sweep of the season on Friday night, winning its home opener against McKendree 3-0, with set scores of 25-21, 25-18, 25-21 at TRAC. The Prairie Stars served 10 aces and held McKendree to a .113 hitting percentage. After an even start to the first set,... Read full article",
